    <!-- Portable Chrome — a silver handheld with the screen off.
         The shell is silver; the screen is not. Surfaces are smoked graphite with a blue
         cast, and the moonlight silver the contract asks for lives in the text, the
         dividers and the rails. Ratios against the card: text 10.35, secondary 6.32,
         muted 4.76, accent 5.00, error 6.76 — measured, not judged by eye. -->
    <color name="nova_portable_bg_window">#FF14161A</color>
    <color name="nova_portable_bg_card">#FF1E2228</color>
